{"meta":{"id":"inheritance","category":"it/syntax/typescript/class","title":"상속 (abstract · interface) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"abstract(extends) 는 공통 기능 + 구현 대상, interface(implements) 는 구현 대상만 — 인덱스 시그니처, instanceof","tags":["typescript","f-class","f-inheritance","f-interface"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">상속 (abstract · interface) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> abstract(extends) 는 공통 기능 + 구현 대상, interface(implements) 는 구현 대상만 — 인덱스 시그니처, instanceof</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">abstract (extends) — 공통 기능 + 구현해야 될 대상 제공</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">abstract class Shape {\r\n  constructor(protected name: string) {}\r\n\r\n  describe() {                         // 공통 기능 (구현 있음)\r\n    return `${this.name}: ${this.area()}`;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  abstract area(): number;             // 자식이 반드시 구현\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Circle extends Shape {\r\n  constructor(private r: number) { super(&quot;circle&quot;); }\r\n  area() { return Math.PI * this.r ** 2; }\r\n}\r\n\r\n// new Shape(&quot;x&quot;);  // 오류: 추상 클래스는 직접 생성 불가</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">interface (implements) — 구현해야 될 대상만 제공</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface Printable {\r\n  print(): void;\r\n}\r\ninterface Savable {\r\n  save(path: string): boolean;\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Report implements Printable, Savable {   // 여러 개 구현 가능\r\n  print() { console.log(&quot;report&quot;); }\r\n  save(path: string) { return true; }\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">인덱스 시그니처 (Index Signature)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface Settings {\r\n  [key: string]: string | number;\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Config implements Settings {\r\n  [key: string]: string | number;\r\n  theme = &quot;dark&quot;;\r\n  size = 14;\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">상속 받은 유무 확인 — instanceof</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const s: Shape = new Circle(2);\r\n\r\nif (s instanceof Circle) {   // 실행 시점에 프로토타입 체인 확인\r\n  s.area();\r\n}\r\n// interface 는 실행 시점에 없으므로 instanceof 불가 → 속성 확인으로 대체\r\nif (&quot;print&quot; in obj) { /* Printable 처럼 사용 */ }</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">abstract vs interface</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">abstract class (extends)</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">interface (implements)</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">구현 코드</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가질 수 있음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">없음 (형태만)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">개수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">하나만 상속</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">여러 개 구현</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">생성자 · 필드</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가능</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">불가</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">실행 시점</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">JS 클래스로 남음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">사라짐</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/class/inheritance","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/typescript/class"}],"hasImage":false}